"Test: $Area, $Slope, $Integral, $Derivative en vectores y matrices
'<hr/>
'<h4>1. Funciones sueltas (referencia)</h4>
#noc
'Area:
A1 = $Area{f(x) @ x = a : b}
'Slope:
S1 = $Slope{f(x) @ x = a}
'Integral:
I1 = $Integral{f(x) @ x = a : b}
'Derivative:
D1 = d/dx(f(x))
'<hr/>
'<h4>2. Dentro de vector [a; b]</h4>
V1 = [$Area{f(x) @ x = a : b}; $Slope{f(x) @ x = a}]
V2 = [$Integral{g(t) @ t = 0 : T}; d/dx(h(x))]
'<hr/>
'<h4>3. Dentro de matriz [a; b | c; d]</h4>
M1 = [$Area{f(x) @ x = 0 : 1}; $Slope{g(x) @ x = 0}|$Integral{h(t) @ t = a : b}; d/dx(p(x))]
'<hr/>
'<h4>4. Modo #equ con valores</h4>
#equ
f(x) = x^2
a = 0
b = 1
'Area numerica:
A2 = $Area{f(x) @ x = a : b}
'Vector con area:
V3 = [$Area{f(x) @ x = a : b}; f(0.5)]
'Matriz con area:
M2 = [$Area{f(x) @ x = a : b}; f(a)|f(b); $Slope{f(x) @ x = a}]
'<hr/>
'<h4>5. Integrales anidadas</h4>
#noc
'Doble integral suelta:
F1 = a_1*b_1*$Area{$Area{N(i; xi; eta)*q @ xi = 0 : 1} @ eta = 0 : 1}
'Triple integral suelta:
F2 = $Area{$Area{$Area{N(i; j; xi; eta)*q @ xi = 0 : 1} @ eta = 0 : 1} @ zeta = 0 : 1}
'Doble integral en vector:
V4 = [a_1*b_1*$Area{$Area{N(1; xi; eta)*q @ xi = 0 : 1} @ eta = 0 : 1}; $Slope{g(x) @ x = 0}]
'Triple integral en matriz:
M3 = [$Area{$Area{$Area{N(1; 1; xi; eta)*q @ xi = 0 : 1} @ eta = 0 : 1} @ zeta = 0 : 1}; f(a)|f(b); $Area{h(t) @ t = 0 : 1}]
